   "en": "Complete the ⟦0⟧ focus. If ⟦1⟧ decides to not divide, you will only get a claim. Do not justify war against them as this may increase World Tension. ⟦2⟧ will have to declare on ⟦3⟧ later. If ⟦4⟧ accepts but ⟦5⟧ refuses, ⟦6⟧ will get a war goal. Declare on the ⟦7⟧ and move quickly. If both countries accept, You will get a ⟦8⟧ Puppet. Decrease their autonomy if that happens.",
