   "en": "The ⟦0⟧ will take Eastern Poland via Molotov-Ribbentrop. Deny the ⟦1⟧ Moldova when they ask for it and then hold out against them after they declare war on you. You can start pushing by yourself or wait until ⟦2⟧ declares war against the ⟦3⟧ to push against them. If you want to push from another direction, you can try to get Military Access with the ⟦4⟧ in order to naval invade Vladivostok from ⟦5⟧. Try to push the ⟦6⟧ more than the ⟦7⟧ in order to take the most territory, especially if you didn't get ⟦8⟧ territory and will have to fight the ⟦9⟧ for it next. Take ⟦10⟧ and Eastern Polish territory if possible.",
