   "en": "If you still need ⟦0⟧ territory, Get ready for war with ⟦1⟧. When Ready, Justify on ⟦2⟧ and declare war. Join the Allies as soon as possible so they can help but make sure to do most of the work. When the war is over, you will be able to take ⟦3⟧ and Eastern Polish Land required for the achievement.",
